    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucy is a cheerful and confident girl who excels in star magic. Since childhood, she has dreamed of becoming a world-renowned grand mage. Both in daily life and magical studies, Lucy works diligently, filling her notebooks with magical theories. She prided herself on her magical talents until she encountered Jeruf's Super Magic Book. To her astonishment, the magic she cast differed completely from the book's descriptions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the Super Magic Book\u00a0flawed? Was it exaggerated? Who exactly is the legendary Grand Mage Jeruf?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie behind this magical scripture? Does the demon sealed by Jeruf truly exist?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Lucy in uncovering the truth hidden behind the Super Magic Book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 2D side-scrolling action-adventure with simple yet engaging gameplay<br>\u2022 Unique grimoire system: Combine spellbook skills with environmental interactions to create diverse magical effects<br>\u2022 Open-world exploration with hidden levels to unlock<br>\u2022 Rich narrative combined with exhilarating combat<br>\u2022 Strategic magic-puzzle integration: Clever spellcasting is essential for progression</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucy is a cheerful and confident girl who excels in star magic. Since childhood, she has dreamed of becoming a world-renowned grand mage. Both in daily life and magical studies, Lucy works diligently, filling her notebooks with magical theories. She prided herself on her magical talents until she encountered Jeruf's Super Magic Book. To her astonishment, the magic she cast differed completely from the book's descriptions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the Super Magic Book\u00a0flawed? Was it exaggerated? Who exactly is the legendary Grand Mage Jeruf?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie behind this magical scripture? Does the demon sealed by Jeruf truly exist?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Lucy in uncovering the truth hidden behind the Super Magic Book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 2D side-scrolling action-adventure with simple yet engaging gameplay<br>\u2022 Unique grimoire system: Combine spellbook skills with environmental interactions to create diverse magical effects<br>\u2022 Open-world exploration with hidden levels to unlock<br>\u2022 Rich narrative combined with exhilarating combat<br>\u2022 Strategic magic-puzzle integration: Clever spellcasting is essential for progression</p>",
    "short_description": "The legendary Grand Mage Jeruf is hailed as the most exceptional mage in history, with his masterpiece recognized as the ultimate grimoire in magical arts - the Super Magic Book. In the game, players will take on the role of Lucy to uncover the hidden secrets within the Super Magic Book.",
